<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 01:45:32 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>OpenAI 推出 GPT-6 Astra，这是迄今为止最强大的模型，并宣传其使用计算机的能力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/openai-debuts-gpt-6-astra-computer-use-greg-brockman-says-start-of-agi/</link><description>OpenAI 总裁格雷格·布罗克曼 (Greg Brockman) 称 Astra “AGI 时代的开始”，尽管外部专家担心该公司是否拥有有效的安全控制措施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2273978158-e1788453763966.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 18:44:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/openai-debuts-gpt-6-astra-computer-use-greg-brockman-says-start-of-agi/</guid></item><item><title>加密货币交易所 Gate 与企业白标构建器一起进入预测市场空间</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/crypto-exchange-gate-enters-prediction-market-space-with-white-label-builder-for-businesses/</link><description>与 Polymarket 合作后，Gate 正在为寻求提供活动合同的企业构建自己的工具。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1479623680-e1788465894494.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/crypto-exchange-gate-enters-prediction-market-space-with-white-label-builder-for-businesses/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能梦想家雷·库兹韦尔 (Ray Kurzweil) 正在加入一家硅谷初创公司，开发涉及吸食纳米粒子的脑计算机系统</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/ai-visionary-ray-kurzweil-is-joining-a-silicon-valley-startup-developing-a-brain-computer-system-that-involves-snorting-nano-particles/</link><description>Subsense 的大脑计算接口可以与埃隆·马斯克的 Neuralink 竞争，但不需要手术。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270288990-e1788460321972.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:02:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/ai-visionary-ray-kurzweil-is-joining-a-silicon-valley-startup-developing-a-brain-computer-system-that-involves-snorting-nano-particles/</guid></item><item><title>为女性平等奋斗数十年的格洛丽亚·斯泰纳姆 (Gloria Steinem) 去世，享年 92 岁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/feminist-icon-gloria-dies-92/</link><description>这位《女士杂志》联合创始人成为六十年来妇女运动最有影响力的声音之一&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26246398405243-e1788446049929.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:38:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/feminist-icon-gloria-dies-92/</guid></item><item><title>安全专家警告 OpenAI 的 Astra 模型的新颖设计可能会使未来的人工智能代理更难监控</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/reports-openais-astra-model-uses-a-new-more-efficient-ai-architecture-alarms-ai-safety-experts-who-worry-the-method-makes-models-harder-to-control/</link><description>OpenAI 的首席科学家表示，该公司致力于确保其模型的推理仍然可解释。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292626872-e1788443677424.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 17:51:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/reports-openais-astra-model-uses-a-new-more-efficient-ai-architecture-alarms-ai-safety-experts-who-worry-the-method-makes-models-harder-to-control/</guid></item><item><title>美国政府问责局发现特勤局在特朗普刺杀企图之前未解决无人机威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/secret-service-protection-policy-security/</link><description>政府问责办公室发现特勤局更新其有关威胁的政策存在延误。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26233818434604-e1788466074132.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:39:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/secret-service-protection-policy-security/</guid></item><item><title>Hugging Face 从一家以表情符号命名的“斗志旺盛”的初创公司，到被 Nvidia 斥资 130 亿美元收购</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/hugging-face-goes-from-a-scrappy-startup-named-after-an-emoji-to-13-billion-nvidia-acquisition/</link><description>这笔交易将鼓励更多主流采用开放权重模型，但人工智能内部人士担心英伟达会巧妙地影响它们全部在其硬件上运行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2183679052-e1788452377178.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:24:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/hugging-face-goes-from-a-scrappy-startup-named-after-an-emoji-to-13-billion-nvidia-acquisition/</guid></item><item><title>随着乌克兰与莫斯科的紧张局势升级，俄罗斯将关闭德国文化中心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/europe-russia-finland-civil-defense-drill/</link><description>周四早些时候，在慕尼黑，几起燃烧装置被投掷到几家公司所在大楼附近的一个建筑工地。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292597251-e1788465566570.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:26:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/europe-russia-finland-civil-defense-drill/</guid></item><item><title>财政部提议通过 DEI 政策取消私立大学的免税地位</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/colleges-dei-trump-tax-exemption-wokeness/</link><description>高等教育联盟主席兼首席执行官迈克·加文(Mike Gavin)表示，政府“试图让美国人民相信，向上就是向下”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291728115-e1788465734566.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:23:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/colleges-dei-trump-tax-exemption-wokeness/</guid></item><item><title>Canva 的生产力提升开始受到关注，而在东南亚，这一切都发生在手机上</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/canva-productivity-milestones-cameron-adams/</link><description>Canva 的用户已经制作了 45 亿份演示文稿和 14 亿份文档，这是其进军微软和谷歌领地的第一个硬数据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270458071-e1788428017333.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/canva-productivity-milestones-cameron-adams/</guid></item></channel></rss>